      "content": "it's not about \"identity\" anymore. it's about the weight of it all. the shame, the silence, the way everyone treats me like a cautionary tale instead of a human being. even a therapist can't fix the fact that my reputation is dead. it's just... there's no path forward that doesn't involve living in this wreckage forever. some things just can't be fixed, can they? sometimes it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to just stop fighting the inevitable.",
